parts":[{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"ocean water"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புணரி","parts":[{"text":"புணரி","lemma":"புணரி","gloss":"ocean/wave"}],"gloss":"ocean waves"},{"surface":"திளைக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"திளைக்கும்","lemma":"திளை","gloss":"splashing"}],"gloss":"splashing"},{"surface":"புள்","parts":[{"text":"புள்","lemma":"புள்","gloss":"bird"}],"gloss":"birds"},{"surface":"இமிழ்","parts":[{"text":"இமிழ்","lemma":"இமிழ்","gloss":"sounding"}],"gloss":"chirping"},{"surface":"கானல்","parts":[{"text":"கானல்","lemma":"கானல்","gloss":"seashore grove"}],"gloss":"seashore grove"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இணர்","parts":[{"text":"இணர்","lemma":"இணர்","gloss":"flower cluster"}],"gloss":"flower clusters"},{"surface":"அவிழ்","parts":[{"text":"அவிழ்","lemma":"அவிழ்","gloss":"blooming"}],"gloss":"blooming"},{"surface":"புன்னை","parts":[{"text":"புன்னை","lemma":"புன்னை","gloss":"mastwood tree"}],"gloss":"Punnai tree"},{"surface":"எக்கர்","parts":[{"text":"எக்கர்","lemma":"எக்கர்","gloss":"sand dune"}],"gloss":"sand dune"},{"surface":"நீழல்","parts":[{"text":"நீழல்","lemma":"நீழல்","gloss":"shade"}],"gloss":"shade"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புணர்","parts":[{"text":"புணர்","lemma":"புணர்","gloss":"unite"}],"gloss":"union"},{"surface":"குறி","parts":[{"text":"குறி","lemma":"குறி","gloss":"tryst"}],"gloss":"tryst"},{"surface":"வாய்த்த","parts":[{"text":"வாய்த்த","lemma":"வாய்த்த","gloss":"succeeded"}],"gloss":"which succeeded"},{"surface":"ஞான்றை","parts":[{"text":"ஞான்றை","lemma":"ஞான்றை","gloss":"time"}],"gloss":"at the time of"},{"surface":"கொண்கன்","parts":[{"text":"கொண்கன்","lemma":"கொண்கன்","gloss":"lord of maritime tract"}],"gloss":"the lord of the shore"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கண்டன","parts":[{"text":"கண்டன","lemma":"காண்","gloss":"saw-they"}],"gloss":"saw"},{"surface":"மன்","parts":[{"text":"மன்","lemma":"மன்","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"எம்","parts":[{"text":"எம்","lemma":"எம்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"கண்ணே","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eye"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"eyes indeed"},{"surface":"அவன்","parts":[{"text":"அவன்","lemma":"அவன்","gloss":"his"}],"gloss":"his"},{"surface":"சொல்","parts":[{"text":"சொல்","lemma":"சொல்","gloss":"word"}],"gloss":"words"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கேட்டன","parts":[{"text":"கேட்டன","lemma":"கேட்டன","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மன்னெஞ்","parts":[{"text":"மன்னெஞ்","lemma":"மன்னெஞ்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"செவியே","parts":[{"text":"செவியே","lemma":"செவியே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மற்றவன்","parts":[{"text":"மற்றவன்","lemma":"மற்றவன்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"மணப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"மணப்பின்","lemma":"மணப்பின்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மாணல","parts":[{"text":"மாணல","lemma":"மாணல","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மெய்தித்","parts":[{"text":"மெய்தித்","lemma":"மெய்தித்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"தணப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"தணப்பின்","lemma":"தணப்பின்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நெகிழ்பவெந்","parts":[{"text":"நெகிழ்பவெந்","lemma":"நெகிழ்பவெந்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தடமென்","parts":[{"text":"தடமென்","lemma":"தடமென்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"றோளே","parts":[{"text":"றோளே","lemma":"றோளே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"What is this, O friend? In the seashore grove where birds chirp and ancient ocean waves splash, / under the shade of the sand dune near the blooming flower clusters of the Punnai tree, / at the time when our secret tryst succeeded, / my eyes indeed saw the lord of the shore, / my ears indeed heard his words; / but when uniting with him, they attain great beauty, / and when parting from him, my broad, soft shoulders slip loose.","translation":"What is this, my friend? In the seashore grove where birds chirp and ancient ocean waves splash, under the shade of the sand dune near the blooming Punnai tree, when our secret tryst succeeded, my eyes saw the lord of the shore and my ears heard his words. But now, while they gain great beauty when we are united, my broad, soft shoulders grow thin and waste away whenever he departs.","modern":"தோழியே! இது என்ன? பழமையான கடல் அலைகள் வந்து மோதும், பறவைகள் ஒலிக்கும் கடற்கரைச் சோலையில், கொத்துக் கொத்தாக மலர்கள் மலர்ந்த புன்னை மரத்தின் நிழலில், மணல் மேட்டில் நம்முடைய சந்திப்பு நிகழ்ந்தபோது, என் கண்கள் அந்தத் தலைவனைக் கண்டன; என் காதுகள் அவனுடைய சொற்களைக் கேட்டன. ஆனால், அவனோடு கூடி இருக்கும்போது மிகுந்த அழகைப் பெறும் என் பருத்த மென்மையான தோள்கள், அவன் பிரிந்து செல்லும்போது மெலிந்து வளைகள் கழலுகின்றனவே!","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend about her distress during temporary separations from her lover. She recalls the sweet moments of their secret meetings in the coastal grove under the shade of the blooming Punnai tree, where her eyes saw him and her ears heard his comforting words. However, she laments the physical toll of separation, noting that her shoulders flourish in his presence but waste away when he leaves. This poem belongs to the Neytal (coastal) landscape, where the sea, sand dunes, and Punnai trees form the backdrop for themes of longing and separation. The physical thinning of the heroine's shoulders is a classic motif representing her deep emotional distress.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}